        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Increased fragmentation of regulatory requirements changes the manner in which we conduct our business and increases our costs because it necessitates the development of country or regional specific variants, monitoring of and compliance with those regulations and additional testing and certifications.",
